      "title": "Sharpe does not survive the selection-adjusted bar",
      "severity": "critical",
      "severity_rank": 4,
      "detail": "Deflated Sharpe is 0.081 against 10000 trials. The observed per-period Sharpe of 0.0811 sits against an expected best-of-10000 under the null of 0.1253.",
